'''120M Download Celebration!''' (1億2000万ダウンロード記念 セレブレーション！, ''Ichioku-nisenman Daunrōdo Kinen Sereburēshon!'', '''120 Million Download Celebration!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

==Overview==
===About===
The 120M Download Celebration! Gauntlet contains a total of 10 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

